#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:5 785d9c6080a74e7cbe33fbe636388a35
msgid "Volz Servos"
msgstr "Volz舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:9 2dbc182d6224496f8eccf93dd99b7e87
msgid ""
"`Volz servos <https://www.volz-servos.com/English/Products/>`__ are high-end"
" servos which can be controlled with a normal PWM signal or using a custom "
"RS-422 serial protocol.  This page describes the setup when using the serial"
" protocol"
msgstr ""
"`Volz舵机 <https://www.volz-servos.com/English/Products/>`__ "
"是高端舵机，可通过普通PWM信号或自定义RS-422串行协议控制。本页介绍使用串行协议时的设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:13 b69f5b9bba9e4d5ba81c8eea76b234aa
msgid ""
"This wiki page is a work-in-progress and has not been verified to be correct"
msgstr "本Wiki页面尚在完善中，未经验证是否完全正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:16 e7e7dee6a24347eea050adfc155bf015
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:18 6085ba0ac1b24704bf01ab9c14b22c63
msgid ""
"Various online retailers sell these servos or you can `contact Volz directly"
" <https://volz-servos.com/contact/?lang=en>`__.  Check the datasheet of the "
"servo to confirm it has the RS-422 serial interface"
msgstr ""
"可从多家在线零售商购买这些舵机，或直接 `联系Volz <https://volz-"
"servos.com/contact/?lang=en>`__。请查阅舵机数据手册确认其具有RS-422串行接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:21 f588c20b079d4e83adf4b0822f69b98a
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接和配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:27 96d5ae9ea1644fb58baf38b1d8fbc694
msgid ""
"image courtesy of the `Volz DA-26 servo datasheet <https://volz-"
"servos.com/resources/Downloads/Datasheets/DA-26_Datasheet_uni.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"图片来源：`Volz DA-26舵机数据手册 <https://volz-"
"servos.com/resources/Downloads/Datasheets/DA-26_Datasheet_uni.pdf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:29 0ec575e4625e471cae45dfc49f47cfff
msgid "Use a BEC to provide power to the servo as shown above"
msgstr "按上图所示使用BEC为舵机供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:30 6ac6df0fbb1e42358a98df4f247afc8a
msgid ""
"Connect the servo's TTL pin to a 5V-to-3V level shifter and then to one of "
"the autopilot's serial port's TX pins.  The diagram above shows the servo "
"connected to a Pixhawk's Serial4 port but other serial ports can also be "
"used"
msgstr ""
"将舵机的TTL引脚连接到5V转3V电平转换器，然后连接到飞控某个串行端口的TX引脚。上图显示舵机连接到Pixhawk的Serial4端口，但也可以使用其他串行端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:31 0da4b84f16bc4628b914f3dd4b4e472c
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (Volz) assuming Serial4 "
"is being used"
msgstr "假设使用Serial4，将 :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 设置为14（Volz）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:33 59296663b6b048f8868cabeeb3344a85
msgid ""
"SERVOn_MIN and SERVOn_MAX corresponding to your Volz servo output channels "
"should be adjusted to specify the 1000-2000 range to obtain full output "
"range of the servo."
msgstr "应调整对应Volz舵机输出通道的SERVOn_MIN和SERVOn_MAX，将其设置为1000-2000的范围，以获得舵机的完整输出范围。"
